  "description": "The Sommet 29 is race proven and capable on any terrain, attacking the downhills in search of bigger drops and steeper descents.\n\nThere is no limit to what the Sommet 29 can handle, with more traction and more control, you will experience the confidence to conquer the mountain. If you’re aiming for the enduro podium or want to push your riding to the limits on your favourite trail, the Sommet 29 is with you all the way.\n\nThis top of the range, all-out Sommet 29 VRX is loaded up with the ultimate spec. Race ready with Fox 36 Factory Fit Grip 2 170mm forks and a Fox Float DPX2 Factory rear shock. DT Swiss EX1501 wheels sitting with Maxxis Assegai tyres takes control of the grip levels. Add in Shimano XT M8120 brakes, Race Face Next R Carbon crankset, Shimano XT / XTR drivetrain and an MRP SXg chain guide, and you’ll never question if you have the right bike for the job again. Finishing off this spec is a Nukeproof cockpit and Brand-X Ascend dropper.\n\nSommet 160mm 6061 Alloy boost Frame\n\nFox Float 36 Factory Fit Grip2 170mm Fork\n\nShimano XTR / XT 12 speed drivetrain\n\nShimano XT Brakes, 203mm rotors\n\nBrand-X Ascend Internal dropper post\n\nMaxxis Assegai Tubeless ready tyres",
